From 5ebbcc98528ef34292bf051413233f36ec7a3f0a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Saalim Quadri <danascape@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 21:53:23 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] SUW: Use Pure Black background for Glif screens on ATV

